SUMMARY:1 Missed Call
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A missed call. A quick call back. 'I’m fine'. This one-man mu
 sical unfolds entirely through phone calls that become songs\, charting one
  ordinary evening as the cracks begin to show. An ex who has moved on. A fa
 ther he cannot impress. A friend he has drifted from. Each conversation pee
 ls back another layer of pressure\, expectation and self-doubt. The music s
 hifts as the mask slips\, blending sharp humour with raw honesty. At its he
 art\, this is a story about masculinity\, silence\, fatherhood and the quie
 t weight many men carry\, even when they insist they are coping.\nMore info
 : https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/1-missed-call/
